{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "ef30767b59fe16e66be7d6eef23ad9cbdf5e226683d5796e7626273e91b015e8", "ja": "なんてゴージャスプリティーな茜ちゃんなんでしょう。\nこれぞまさに、高嶺の花……ってやつだね！", "zh": "真是华丽又可爱的小茜啊。\n这正是所谓的高岭之花……对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1001_p", "source_sha256": "457975d1dc6c5485d7b329cd7b3d01cbe401384350747ad6df2f6713dacf525c", "ja": "お疲れ様、茜。\n高嶺の花はちょっと違うんじゃないか……？", "zh": "辛苦了，茜。\n“高岭之花”应该不太合适吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "c7ea77a5fec08e6ab36b77830cc266bd204e9a3123752b1d942a940b465c7581", "ja": "あ、{$P$}ちゃん！\n今の茜ちゃんにこれ以上ピッタリな言葉はないんだよ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n没有比这更适合现在的小茜的词了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "ccec21576caab5dd7968a6065a08ce3c743808c31321e32701b6eaa56dd35c24", "ja": "この衣装を着た茜ちゃんはまさに！\nゴージャスプリティーなお姫様！", "zh": "穿上这身服装的小茜简直就是！  \n华丽又可爱的小公主！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "170a3a790234583bc02303155b55ea37fbb1e6cba381fee2d3890348c0c4e449", "ja": "上品でお淑やかなことはもちろん、隠し切れない\n高貴なオーラが溢れ出して止まらな～い！", "zh": "不仅高贵优雅，还散发出完全无法掩饰的贵族气质，简直停不下来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "6656cdbaa25f453763cccea3ae4e3bda79cec6d6c5ea65dd7c3162755495ed5c", "ja": "ハッ！　{$P$}ちゃん、どうしよう！\n茜ちゃん、大変なことに気づいちゃった！", "zh": "哈！{$P$}，怎么办！\n小茜发现了一件不得了的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1006_p", "source_sha256": "26ae147673811f35819a9e1aab76113583ffec4514aa866b6e93fa40ed9b9b0d", "ja": "一体、何に気づいたんだ？", "zh": "到底发现什么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "f80645190930889d549688cfde30d54539734644fb57f7f5d2ad264b1e3d342f", "ja": "茜ちゃんの魅力ってなんだと思う？　そうだよ、\n{$P$}ちゃん！　親しみやすさだね！", "zh": "你觉得小茜的魅力是什么？没错，{$P$}！就是亲切好相处！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1008_p", "source_sha256": "92b1cdcbe98edaaac8907dc0936f2ad1777e54a26c748cf98c1265be1c0c8a53", "ja": "いや、何も言ってないけど……。", "zh": "不，我什么都没说啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "e082bf620fcb2c09659989970e8da328c09e80ea7f6a01c659871920a55beca7", "ja": "でも高貴なお姫様オーラが、それを掻き消してしまう\n……親しみやすさが犠牲になっちゃうよ～！", "zh": "可是，高贵的公主气场会把那个彻底掩盖掉……\n这样一来就会牺牲亲和力啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1010_p", "source_sha256": "30614e807587a745b6153406979d1ce5e5d8a2c01da423918daa429ef2a61af5", "ja": "確かに、それは問題だな。でもお姫様の中には\n親しみやすい人もいるだろうし、大丈夫じゃ……。", "zh": "确实，这是个问题。不过公主里面也有亲切随和的人，应该没问题……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "edbbbd35dcc889adcd206035e9b75d01cdbec66c7a68eba003e2be29da3b8813", "ja": "チッチッチッ。ダメだよ、それは！\n中途半端な売り出し方は、一番ヤッちゃダメ～！", "zh": "啧啧啧。不行，这可不行！\n半吊子的宣传方式，是最不该搞的啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "f4d1de60695036ef3550ab7fbbcb30405c8ee31c892607d59fc4d6605d547a07", "ja": "お姫様と高級感で、高嶺の花感をアピ～ル！\n神出鬼没なレアアイドルとしての宣伝一択でしょ！", "zh": "用公主气质和高级感，宣传那种高不可攀的感觉！\n作为神出鬼没的稀有偶像，宣传路线就该选这一条嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a013e5a2c70b72ba97083b411e656bf66c55b39d4663024b896ce5b4aa6f5b20", "ja": "そ、そうか……分かった。\n茜がそこまで言うなら、今後はその方針でいこう。", "zh": "这、这样啊……知道了。\n既然茜都这么说了，以后就按这个方针来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a110c32c093a9a734decba8fbe302ef68a8006628c37058fb5c812706969fa40", "ja": "まず、予定してた握手会は中止にするとして……。", "zh": "首先，原定的握手会就取消吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
