{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0424_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "b74c0662e6d6edfca5eb3dce1bcec5ad70fbc45db71ad0d54efad7d3ed5ae7a0", "ja": "ふぅ……危なかった。\n『茜ちゃんの顔つきヘアゴム』商品化決定！　よしッ☆", "zh": "呼……好险。\n“小茜表情发圈”商品化决定！好耶☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
